1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,682
Marinette, j'ai une super nouvelle !
Marinette, I have great news!

2
00:00:03,982 --> 00:00:07,438
Ah oui ? C'est quoi ?
Oh yeah? What is it?

3
00:00:07,738 --> 00:00:12,610
Je pars à Paris ce week-end ! C'est top, non ?
I'm going to Paris this weekend! It's great, right?

4
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:14,782
Trop bien !
So cool!

5
00:00:15,082 --> 00:00:17,554
On se retrouve à la gare ?
Shall we meet at the station?

6
00:00:17,854 --> 00:00:21,550
Ça marche ! À quelle heure ?
Works for me! What time?

7
00:00:21,850 --> 00:00:23,818
À huit heures.
At eight.

8
00:00:24,118 --> 00:00:27,838
Nickel ! À samedi !
Perfect! See you Saturday!

